flowchart TD
    A[Start: visible symptom] --> B[Repo-first orientation<br/>What does app do?<br/>What depends on what?<br/>How does it deploy?]
    B --> C{Scope clear?}

    C -- No --> D[Full triage<br/>context -> namespaces -> pods -> deploys -> svcs -> ingress -> events]
    C -- Yes --> E[Fast path<br/>go straight to likely workload]

    D --> F[Check pods]
    E --> F

    F --> G{Are pods healthy?}

    G -- No --> H{Pod symptom}

    H --> H1[ImagePullBackOff / ErrImagePull / CreateContainer*]
    H --> H2[CrashLoopBackOff / Error / Init:*]
    H --> H3[Running but 0/1 Ready]
    H --> H4[Running/Ready but restarts climbing]
    H --> H5[Pending]

    H1 --> I1[Image pull / container creation]
    H3 --> I3[Probe failure]
    H4 --> I4[Probe failure<br/>or Startup / crash]
    H5 --> I5[Resource / scheduling / storage]

    H2 --> J[Startup / crash hub<br/>describe pod -> logs -> previous logs -> init logs]
    J --> K{What do logs say?}

    K --> K1[Missing ConfigMap / Secret / wrong env ref]
    K --> K2[Name or service not known / bad hostname]
    K --> K3[Connection refused / auth failed / wrong DB name]
    K --> K4[OOMKilled / exit 137]
    K --> K5[Bad command / bad entrypoint / startup failure]
    K --> K6[Probe-related kill]

    K1 --> I6[Config / Secret / env]
    K2 --> I7[DNS / service discovery / namespace<br/>and maybe Config / Secret / env]
    K3 --> I8[Application-level dependency / runtime<br/>and maybe Config / Secret / env]
    K4 --> I5
    K5 --> I1
    K6 --> I3

    G -- Yes --> L[Test reachability layer by layer]

    L --> M[Test pod directly]
    M --> N{Pod responds?}

    N -- No --> I8
    N -- Yes --> O[Test service + endpoints]

    O --> P{Service works?}

    P -- No --> Q{Why not?}
    Q --> Q1[Empty endpoints]
    Q --> Q2[Selector mismatch]
    Q --> Q3[Port / targetPort mismatch]
    Q1 --> R{Pods Ready?}
    R -- No --> I3
    R -- Yes --> I9[Service routing / port / endpoint]
    Q2 --> I9
    Q3 --> I9

    P -- Yes --> S[Test ingress / external path]
    S --> T{Ingress works?}

    T -- No --> U{What kind of failure?}
    U --> U1[Service works, external path fails]
    U --> U2[Everything looks healthy, traffic silently times out]
    U1 --> I10[Ingress / external routing]
    U2 --> I11[NetworkPolicy / traffic restriction]

    F --> V{Forbidden / Unauthorized?}
    V -- Yes --> I12[RBAC / service account / permission]
    V -- No --> W{Resources seem missing?}
    W -- Yes --> I7
    W -- No --> X{Job / CronJob issue?}
    X -- Yes --> I13[Jobs / CronJobs<br/>or route failing job pod back through normal tree]
    X -- No --> Y{Rollout stuck?}
    Y -- Yes --> I14[Deployment / rollout view<br/>then inspect new pods and route back]
    Y -- No --> Z[Apply smallest justified fix]

    I1 --> Z
    I3 --> Z
    I4 --> Z
    I5 --> Z
    I6 --> Z
    I7 --> Z
    I8 --> Z
    I9 --> Z
    I10 --> Z
    I11 --> Z
    I12 --> Z
    I13 --> Z
    I14 --> Z

    Z --> AA[Verify end-to-end<br/>pods -> endpoints -> service -> ingress -> expected response]